    "text": "In accordance with the Decision No. 398 dated 07.12.2023, I, W. M. L. Somachandra, the secretary of the Pradeshiya Sabha Nawagaththegama do hereby decide that the roads and thoroughfares among the roads and thoroughfares mentioned in the list set out in the Schedule of the Notification published in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 2342/43 dated 28.07.2023, for which a case has not be filed in the proper court and are included in the schedule below should be confirmed as the roads and thoroughfares owned by the Pradeshiya Sabha Nawagaththegama, by virtue of powers vested under the Orders in the series of",
